            <div xml:id="d375">

                <pb facs="0422" n="356" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg356"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.516/284: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-05-15T12:00:00-05:00">May 15, 1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        12:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>47. My telegram No. 42, May 11, 1 p.m. Could a reply be expedited as the
                    President is sending the contract to the Legislature tomorrow and would like to
                    have it accompanied by the draft notes and draft treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
